the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Alter des Antragstellers of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Jahreseinkommen of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Härtefall anerkannt of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    the Bundesland des Wohnsitzes of *a case* is *a text*; scenario element.
    Fördervoraussetzungen holds for *a case*.
    Antragsteller volljährig holds for *a case*.
    Einkommensprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Einkommen unter Grenze holds for *a case*.
    Härtefall anerkannt holds for *a case*.
    Wohnsitz in Bayern holds for *a case*.
    Antragsteller volljährig would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Einkommen unter Grenze would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r5_1_foerderantrag includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/foerderantrag.ruml".

Fördervoraussetzungen holds for a case if
    Antragsteller volljährig holds for the case
    and Einkommensprüfung holds for the case
    and Wohnsitz in Bayern holds for the case.

Antragsteller volljährig holds for a case if
    the Alter des Antragstellers of the case is a number N
    and N >= 18.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Antragsteller volljährig holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Alter des Antragstellers of the case is a number
    and Antragsteller volljährig would hold for the case.

Einkommensprüfung holds for a case if
    Einkommen unter Grenze holds for the case.

Einkommensprüfung holds for a case if
    Härtefall anerkannt holds for the case.

Wohnsitz in Bayern holds for a case if
    the Bundesland des Wohnsitzes of the case is "BY".

Einkommen unter Grenze holds for a case if
    the Jahreseinkommen of the case is a number N
    and N <= 40000.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Einkommen unter Grenze holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Jahreseinkommen of the case is a number
    and Einkommen unter Grenze would hold for the case.

Härtefall anerkannt holds for a case if
    the Härtefall anerkannt of the case is true.

